====================================================
KEY TAKEAWAYS
====================================================

Cloud architecture is not only infrastructure.
Real systems require secure access design, scalability planning, and product architecture thinking.
SaaS products require strong tenant isolation and operational lifecycle awareness.
System design thinking is becoming an important part of the Cloud Architect journey.

Day 11 was focused on learning how architecture supports real-world scalable products.